## Use this API

`AgentSession::new → AgentSession::run`

Dependencies / prerequisites (use the same Runifold release family):

- runifold with sqlite-bundled
- runifold-testkit
- tokio
- anyhow
- No vendor credentials required

## Minimal example

The following is extracted from [the compiled source](../../../crates/runifold/examples/durable_session.rs).
